1
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,000
"Bittersweet Love"

2
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:34,600
(Episode 10)

3
00:01:34,625 --> 00:01:35,999
I know Bei Lüqing got inside info,

4
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,625
that's why he's acting this bold.

5
00:01:47,625 --> 00:01:49,125
Why are you watching him all day?

6
00:01:49,666 --> 00:01:51,166
Can't you do something else?

7
00:01:51,916 --> 00:01:53,500
We are set to join the WTO.

8
00:01:53,875 --> 00:01:54,708
Bei Lüqing's gang

9
00:01:54,709 --> 00:01:56,000
knew this long before us.

10
00:01:59,750 --> 00:02:02,416
WTO, the World Trade Organization.

11
00:02:03,208 --> 00:02:05,501
Next month, the Ministry of
Agriculture will grant export permits

12
00:02:05,525 --> 00:02:07,685
for our agricultural products
as a gesture of goodwill.

13
00:02:10,041 --> 00:02:10,625
So what?

14
00:02:10,708 --> 00:02:11,708
So what?

15
00:02:13,125 --> 00:02:14,874
If any farm product is cleared for import,

16
00:02:14,875 --> 00:02:17,291
its futures price will plummet.

17
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:18,915
Once we find out

18
00:02:18,916 --> 00:02:21,041
which product will be opened to imports,

19
00:02:21,958 --> 00:02:23,458
we go short on it.

20
00:02:23,833 --> 00:02:26,113
Short a hundred grand,
you could make at least a million.

21
00:02:26,250 --> 00:02:27,250
With a bit of luck,

22
00:02:27,375 --> 00:02:29,291
we could net several million, Xiaofan.

23
00:02:32,875 --> 00:02:35,166
I wasn't counting on you
to get any intel anyway.

24
00:02:35,458 --> 00:02:36,498
I'll get the intel myself.

25
00:02:37,708 --> 00:02:38,875
But I'm guessing

26
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,541
this commodity

27
00:02:41,208 --> 00:02:42,708
is most likely corn.

28
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:44,809
Lüqing has been watching corn positions

29
00:02:44,833 --> 00:02:45,666
very closely recently.

30
00:02:45,667 --> 00:02:47,307
In and out, he's done quite a few trades.

31
00:02:47,708 --> 00:02:48,828
All his positions are small,

32
00:02:49,416 --> 00:02:51,249
yet his entry timing is really odd.

33
00:02:51,250 --> 00:02:52,458
Like he's testing the waters.

34
00:02:54,083 --> 00:02:54,916
Corn at the wet market

35
00:02:54,917 --> 00:02:56,237
has gone up to fifty cents a jin.

36
00:02:56,750 --> 00:02:58,291
I heard from a corn grower

37
00:02:59,083 --> 00:03:00,723
that fewer people planted corn this year.

38
00:03:00,833 --> 00:03:02,750
Supplies for next year
are bound to be tight.

39
00:03:03,458 --> 00:03:04,750
How can corn futures drop then?

40
00:03:04,916 --> 00:03:05,916
What do you know?

41
00:03:06,291 --> 00:03:07,957
You think trading's just grocery shopping?

42
00:03:07,958 --> 00:03:09,208
It's all politics.

43
00:03:09,291 --> 00:03:10,375
And economics.

44
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:13,291
The second the import news comes out,

45
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:14,582
futures will surely drop,

46
00:03:14,583 --> 00:03:16,041
shortage or not.

47
00:03:16,625 --> 00:03:18,499
This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance.

48
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:20,142
I just need another one
hundred thousand yuan

49
00:03:20,166 --> 00:03:21,291
to open the account.

50
00:03:22,083 --> 00:03:23,083
But...

51
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,480
I don't even have a hundred thousand.

52
00:03:26,291 --> 00:03:27,291
What?

53
00:03:28,083 --> 00:03:29,083
No way?

54
00:03:29,375 --> 00:03:30,790
You've been with the
Beis four or five years,

55
00:03:30,791 --> 00:03:32,309
and you don't even have a hundred thousand?

56
00:03:32,333 --> 00:03:33,375
Are you kidding me?

57
00:03:34,125 --> 00:03:35,916
You want for nothing at the Beis'.

58
00:03:36,041 --> 00:03:38,934
The Beis hand you spending money. It
must've been over a hundred thousand yuan.

59
00:03:38,958 --> 00:03:40,238
And you haven't saved any of it?

60
00:03:42,833 --> 00:03:43,833
Xiaofan.

61
00:03:44,166 --> 00:03:45,500
I know you're tight-fisted.

62
00:03:45,708 --> 00:03:47,458
But I won't stiff you.

63
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:49,500
Tell you what.

64
00:03:49,625 --> 00:03:50,875
How about a sixty-forty split?

65
00:03:51,041 --> 00:03:51,958
Sixty for me, forty for you.

66
00:03:52,041 --> 00:03:53,281
Brothers getting rich together.

67
00:03:53,375 --> 00:03:54,375
I really don't have it.

68
00:03:56,916 --> 00:03:57,916
Xiaofan.

69
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,124
Are you holding me back
from striking it rich on purpose?

70
00:04:00,125 --> 00:04:01,125
I really don't have it.

71
00:04:03,458 --> 00:04:04,790
I don't know if you hate me

72
00:04:04,791 --> 00:04:05,791
or hate making money.

73
00:04:20,833 --> 00:04:21,833
Bro.

74
00:04:22,083 --> 00:04:23,500
I need to tell you something.

75
00:04:23,541 --> 00:04:24,333
What's up?
Is it serious?

76
00:04:25,791 --> 00:04:28,208
You need to watch out
for my brother these days.

77
00:04:28,791 --> 00:04:29,875
I feel like he's...

78
00:04:30,125 --> 00:04:31,249
I'm swamped these days.

79
00:04:31,250 --> 00:04:32,499
I probably won't come back.

80
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,958
Just relax and stay put.

81
00:04:49,958 --> 00:04:50,750
Xiaofan.

82
00:04:50,833 --> 00:04:52,040
Do you have a screw loose,

83
00:04:52,041 --> 00:04:53,392
or are your wires crossed up there?

84
00:04:53,416 --> 00:04:55,416
You're thick-headed, we know it too.

85
00:04:55,666 --> 00:04:56,666
But right now,

86
00:04:56,708 --> 00:04:58,541
your brother's offering you riches,

87
00:04:58,666 --> 00:05:00,000
yet you still turn it down.

88
00:05:00,125 --> 00:05:01,541
What on earth is wrong with you?

89
00:05:02,083 --> 00:05:04,708
Scared your brother won't pay you back?

90
00:05:04,916 --> 00:05:07,125
I'm swallowing my pride here.

91
00:05:07,458 --> 00:05:09,040
Can you lend me some money?

92
00:05:09,041 --> 00:05:09,708
Dad.

93
00:05:09,916 --> 00:05:11,000
I've got no cash.

94
00:05:11,250 --> 00:05:12,625
You... You stubborn brat!

95
00:05:12,875 --> 00:05:13,541
Old lady,
come here.

96
00:05:14,376 --> 00:05:16,875
Ask Xiaofan what he really means.

97
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:18,041
Does he never want

98
00:05:18,208 --> 00:05:19,916
to come back to this family?

99
00:05:20,083 --> 00:05:22,165
It wasn't just a loan from his brother.

100
00:05:22,166 --> 00:05:24,040
He wanted to take him along to get rich.

101
00:05:24,041 --> 00:05:25,041
Xiaoping said

102
00:05:25,208 --> 00:05:26,290
if this works out,

103
00:05:26,291 --> 00:05:27,415
he'll be our village's

104
00:05:27,416 --> 00:05:29,249
first millionaire.

105
00:05:29,250 --> 00:05:30,582
Don't borrow money from Xiaofan.

106
00:05:30,583 --> 00:05:33,684
Xiaoping's acting rashly and foolishly,
and you're being just as reckless.

107
00:05:33,708 --> 00:05:37,833
If he keeps a 10k-a-month
job, the Lus will be blessed.

108
00:05:37,958 --> 00:05:38,708
Forget about a million.

109
00:05:38,709 --> 00:05:39,833
Don't dwell on it endlessly.

110
00:05:40,166 --> 00:05:41,666
He's far too greedy and ambitious.

111
00:05:42,208 --> 00:05:42,625
Enough.

112
00:05:43,083 --> 00:05:44,101
Stop giving Xiaofan a hard time.

113
00:05:44,125 --> 00:05:45,245
Let him do his job in peace.

114
00:05:45,708 --> 00:05:46,166
Xiaofan.

115
00:05:46,333 --> 00:05:48,125
Talk some sense into your brother.

116
00:05:48,416 --> 00:05:50,208
Stop him from hatching wild schemes.

117
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:52,250
Alright.

118
00:06:02,458 --> 00:06:03,458
Lu Xiaoping.

119
00:06:03,875 --> 00:06:04,833
What exactly are you trying to do?
Quit yelling here.

120
00:06:06,250 --> 00:06:07,415
I don't need your money

121
00:06:07,416 --> 00:06:08,500
or your help right now.

122
00:06:09,125 --> 00:06:10,708
What I do is none of your business.

123
00:06:11,041 --> 00:06:12,333
Mom told me everything.

124
00:06:12,375 --> 00:06:14,250
These are folks' hard-earned savings.

125
00:06:14,875 --> 00:06:16,275
So you know it's hard-earned money.

126
00:06:16,708 --> 00:06:17,541
Everyone in our village
slogs their whole lives

127
00:06:18,334 --> 00:06:19,374
just to save a little cash.

128
00:06:19,375 --> 00:06:21,000
Why can't I help everyone make money?

129
00:06:21,625 --> 00:06:23,185
Only Bei Lüqing deserves to earn money?

130
00:06:24,125 --> 00:06:25,125
Enough.

131
00:06:25,541 --> 00:06:26,957
I'm not wasting my breath on you.

132
00:06:26,958 --> 00:06:28,038
I'm going to work overtime.

133
00:06:29,041 --> 00:06:30,041
You...

134
00:06:43,625 --> 00:06:44,625
Xiaofan.

135
00:06:44,875 --> 00:06:45,875
What a coincidence!

136
00:06:46,541 --> 00:06:47,541
Wenxi.

137
00:06:48,291 --> 00:06:49,291
It sure is a coincidence.

138
00:06:49,708 --> 00:06:50,708
You...

139
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,624
Wenxi.

140
00:06:52,625 --> 00:06:54,125
This is...

141
00:06:55,083 --> 00:06:56,083
This...

142
00:06:56,541 --> 00:06:58,000
This is your fiancé.

143
00:06:58,333 --> 00:06:59,375
Bei Lüqing's

144
00:06:59,541 --> 00:07:00,541
brother-in-law.

145
00:07:01,291 --> 00:07:01,750
Wenxi.

146
00:07:01,751 --> 00:07:02,951
You're talking nonsense again.

147
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:06,500
Hello.

148
00:07:06,583 --> 00:07:07,583
My name is Song Qianyu.

149
00:07:07,666 --> 00:07:08,666
I'm from Gangcheng.

150
00:07:08,708 --> 00:07:09,708
Pleased to meet you.

151
00:07:10,291 --> 00:07:11,083
Hello.

152
00:07:11,291 --> 00:07:12,291
I'm Bei Lüqing's...

153
00:07:13,125 --> 00:07:14,125
brother-in-law,

154
00:07:14,333 --> 00:07:15,333
Lu Xiaofan.

155
00:07:16,166 --> 00:07:16,666
Qianyu.

156
00:07:16,791 --> 00:07:17,934
Why don't you head back first?

157
00:07:17,958 --> 00:07:18,583
I fear

158
00:07:18,584 --> 00:07:20,144
your mother-in-law's waiting anxiously.

159
00:07:20,833 --> 00:07:21,916
I'll go grab a drink.

160
00:07:21,958 --> 00:07:22,750
I'm waiting for someone.
Wenxi.

161
00:07:23,376 --> 00:07:24,500
You're always teasing me.

162
00:07:25,250 --> 00:07:26,125
I'll be off then.
Xiaofan.

163
00:07:26,583 --> 00:07:26,958
Bye.

164
00:07:27,125 --> 00:07:28,125
ALright.

165
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:30,541
Xiaofan.
Got a moment?

166
00:07:31,541 --> 00:07:32,941
How about we grab a drink together?

167
00:07:33,375 --> 00:07:34,375
I'm meeting someone.

168
00:07:34,666 --> 00:07:35,333
But,

169
00:07:35,625 --> 00:07:36,790
I feel like it would be even better

170
00:07:36,791 --> 00:07:37,916
if you were there.

171
00:07:44,041 --> 00:07:44,666
Hi,

172
00:07:44,667 --> 00:07:46,416
one cold brew, please.

173
00:07:47,291 --> 00:07:48,541
Xiaofan, and you?

174
00:07:50,166 --> 00:07:51,833
Still cappuccino?

175
00:07:54,625 --> 00:07:56,166
Another cappuccino, please.

176
00:07:56,708 --> 00:07:57,708
Thank you.

177
00:08:03,291 --> 00:08:04,750
Actually, Bei Lüqing and I

178
00:08:05,125 --> 00:08:06,333
broke up ages ago.

179
00:08:07,083 --> 00:08:10,381
We got together at sixteen.

180
00:08:11,250 --> 00:08:12,250
But then

181
00:08:12,416 --> 00:08:14,625
his mother, Mrs. Shen-Wu Bei, found out.

182
00:08:15,708 --> 00:08:17,416
She said we had to break up.

183
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:18,541
Or else

184
00:08:18,542 --> 00:08:19,875
she would notify my father.

185
00:08:20,583 --> 00:08:24,166
Though I'm the eldest son,
my father was quite a playboy.

186
00:08:25,083 --> 00:08:25,916
So

187
00:08:25,917 --> 00:08:27,208
I have many younger brothers.

188
00:08:28,166 --> 00:08:29,166
In the end,

189
00:08:29,375 --> 00:08:30,958
we split up.

190
00:08:33,750 --> 00:08:35,416
Don't hold a grudge against me for this.

191
00:08:36,791 --> 00:08:38,291
Bei Lüqing cast you aside,

192
00:08:38,625 --> 00:08:41,190
so he used me to
cut all ties with you.

193
00:08:42,416 --> 00:08:43,416
Okay, thank you.

194
00:08:46,416 --> 00:08:48,125
You're telling me all this,

195
00:08:49,166 --> 00:08:50,166
is it because...

196
00:08:53,625 --> 00:08:56,041
Relationships for folks like us

197
00:08:56,333 --> 00:08:58,125
are just a game.

198
00:08:58,791 --> 00:08:59,915
In the game,

199
00:08:59,916 --> 00:09:00,916
it's just a game.

200
00:09:01,416 --> 00:09:02,791
Outside of it,

201
00:09:03,208 --> 00:09:04,208
it's reality.

202
00:09:06,083 --> 00:09:07,250
When I was engaged before,

203
00:09:07,458 --> 00:09:08,458
Lüqing was upset.

204
00:09:09,083 --> 00:09:10,666
Now he's engaged himself.

205
00:09:12,291 --> 00:09:13,291
Xiaofan.

206
00:09:13,916 --> 00:09:15,541
You're not one of us.

207
00:09:16,541 --> 00:09:18,500
You can't play during game time.

208
00:09:18,875 --> 00:09:19,999
And be real when it's time to be real.

209
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,000
Sorry, sorry.

210
00:09:21,125 --> 00:09:21,875
Sorry, sorry.

211
00:09:21,876 --> 00:09:23,083
Mr. Li, I'm late.

212
00:09:25,625 --> 00:09:26,083
Mr. Lu.

213
00:09:26,416 --> 00:09:27,416
Have a seat.

214
00:09:27,541 --> 00:09:28,749
I'd think your brother

215
00:09:28,750 --> 00:09:30,290
wouldn't mess up your plans.

216
00:09:30,291 --> 00:09:31,291
Yeah, yeah.

217
00:09:31,375 --> 00:09:31,958
It's just

218
00:09:32,166 --> 00:09:33,286
about making money together.

219
00:09:33,541 --> 00:09:34,621
Just making money together.

220
00:09:36,125 --> 00:09:36,750
Don't worry.

221
00:09:36,958 --> 00:09:39,375
I won't do anything to Bei Luqing either.

222
00:09:39,916 --> 00:09:40,916
Business is business.

223
00:09:41,041 --> 00:09:42,041
I'm not that childish.

224
00:09:42,541 --> 00:09:43,375
Right, of course.

225
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:44,500
I know that.

226
00:09:44,583 --> 00:09:46,232
Mainly I'm afraid...
my brother...

227
00:09:46,375 --> 00:09:47,375
Well, he...

228
00:09:47,791 --> 00:09:48,791
He's not very bright.

229
00:09:49,208 --> 00:09:50,328
He might get the wrong idea.

230
00:09:54,333 --> 00:09:55,333
Xiaofan.

231
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,082
I don't need

232
00:09:58,083 --> 00:09:59,625
Mr. Lu to do anything tough.

233
00:10:00,625 --> 00:10:03,150
Just tell me Bei Lüqing's positions, that's all.

234
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:14,500
As promised,

235
00:10:14,625 --> 00:10:16,540
here's a cashier's check for 200,000.

236
00:10:16,541 --> 00:10:17,833
Cash it anytime.

237
00:10:18,958 --> 00:10:20,666
I certainly trust Mr. Li.

238
00:10:21,125 --> 00:10:22,499
Someone of Mr. Li's standing,

239
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:23,625
what's there not to trust?

240
00:10:26,125 --> 00:10:27,125
Wenxi.

241
00:10:28,250 --> 00:10:30,125
If you want to build positions with Bei,

242
00:10:30,208 --> 00:10:31,708
just partner up with him directly.

243
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:33,083
Really.

244
00:10:33,375 --> 00:10:35,255
- My brother is unreliable...
- Are you kidding me?

245
00:10:35,541 --> 00:10:37,583
Is Bei Luqing your
brother, or am I?

246
00:10:39,333 --> 00:10:40,500
Compared to that,

247
00:10:41,250 --> 00:10:43,000
I trust information obtained

248
00:10:43,166 --> 00:10:44,326
with cold hard cash far more.

249
00:10:44,916 --> 00:10:45,916
For the family's sake,

250
00:10:46,083 --> 00:10:48,291
I can't owe Lüqing too many favors.

251
00:10:48,583 --> 00:10:49,583
Business is business.

252
00:10:49,750 --> 00:10:50,990
That would be too inconvenient.

253
00:10:51,333 --> 00:10:51,791
Certainly.

254
00:10:52,166 --> 00:10:54,208
These are matters for
big shots like Mr. Li.

255
00:10:54,333 --> 00:10:55,041
A single observation

256
00:10:55,291 --> 00:10:57,051
is worth ten years of
figuring it out alone.

257
00:10:58,250 --> 00:10:59,250
Xiaofan.

258
00:10:59,458 --> 00:11:01,250
You still live at Lüqing's.

259
00:11:02,041 --> 00:11:04,333
If you give me more intel on him,

260
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,458
even if it all amounts to nothing...

261
00:11:05,459 --> 00:11:07,041
I've always kept out of these things.

262
00:11:10,250 --> 00:11:11,250
Four hundred thousand.

263
00:11:11,833 --> 00:11:13,000
Mr. Li's really generous.

264
00:11:13,916 --> 00:11:14,916
Mr. Li, rest assured.

265
00:11:15,166 --> 00:11:16,207
I'll handle the deal

266
00:11:16,208 --> 00:11:17,208
with Xiaofan.

267
00:11:22,916 --> 00:11:24,957
Maybe next time we meet,

268
00:11:24,958 --> 00:11:26,290
we'll strike a deal

269
00:11:26,291 --> 00:11:27,541
with Mr. Lu.

270
00:11:29,125 --> 00:11:30,125
Today,

271
00:11:30,375 --> 00:11:31,916
I'm glad to treat everyone to coffee.

272
00:11:32,125 --> 00:11:32,666
I'll be going now.

273
00:11:32,708 --> 00:11:33,833
Wenxi.

274
00:11:35,250 --> 00:11:37,375
You're doing this right in front of me.

275
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,000
Don't you fear I'll tell Bei Lüqing?

276
00:11:43,625 --> 00:11:45,166
Xiaofan, you're clever.

277
00:11:46,041 --> 00:11:47,041
What you're after,

278
00:11:47,083 --> 00:11:48,666
Lüqing may not be able to give you.

279
00:11:49,250 --> 00:11:50,333
Just like back then,

280
00:11:50,625 --> 00:11:51,945
he couldn't give it to me either.

281
00:11:53,125 --> 00:11:55,125
This 400 grand may not be what you want,

282
00:11:55,791 --> 00:11:56,791
but

283
00:11:57,083 --> 00:11:59,041
it's yours to hold tight.

284
00:12:16,416 --> 00:12:17,458
Xiaofan.

285
00:12:17,541 --> 00:12:18,625
Have you seen your bro?

286
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:19,791
I stayed at the door,

287
00:12:20,041 --> 00:12:21,457
yet he won't see me.

288
00:12:21,458 --> 00:12:22,499
Your dad pooled all the villagers' money

289
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:23,875
and gave it to Xiaoping.

290
00:12:24,208 --> 00:12:26,291
Granny Liu even emptied her funeral fund.

291
00:12:26,500 --> 00:12:27,832
They're all counting on Xiaoping

292
00:12:27,833 --> 00:12:29,517
to get an official post and make them rich.

293
00:12:29,541 --> 00:12:31,082
I couldn't hold them back either.

294
00:12:31,083 --> 00:12:32,166
What are you crying for?

295
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:34,583
This is their trust in us.

296
00:12:34,916 --> 00:12:36,392
They're bringing us in to make money.

297
00:12:36,416 --> 00:12:37,041
Xiaofan.

298
00:12:37,042 --> 00:12:39,583
Mom, what can I do?

299
00:12:40,708 --> 00:12:42,875
I know they've gone too far.

300
00:12:43,250 --> 00:12:44,583
I'm not begging you,

301
00:12:44,958 --> 00:12:46,625
but what else can I do?

302
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:11,791
Take it easy.

303
00:13:42,166 --> 00:13:43,166
Bro.

304
00:13:43,541 --> 00:13:44,708
Not done working yet?

305
00:13:45,125 --> 00:13:46,458
Have you been drinking?

306
00:13:46,541 --> 00:13:48,000
Do you need me to pick you up?

307
00:13:48,541 --> 00:13:49,541
Luqing.

308
00:13:49,916 --> 00:13:52,125
Who's calling this late?

309
00:13:52,833 --> 00:13:53,833
Coming home

310
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,375
for congee tomorrow morning?

311
00:14:43,458 --> 00:14:44,458
Bro.

312
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,000
You are...

313
00:14:47,291 --> 00:14:48,791
You must be Lu Xiaofan.

314
00:14:49,541 --> 00:14:51,166
I'm here to do the cleaning.

315
00:14:51,875 --> 00:14:52,875
Hello, hello.

316
00:14:53,041 --> 00:14:54,208
No need, really.

317
00:14:54,666 --> 00:14:56,416
I was sent here by Mr. Bei.

318
00:14:57,041 --> 00:14:58,500
Sorry to disturb you so early.

319
00:14:58,666 --> 00:14:59,875
Please go back to sleep.

320
00:15:07,708 --> 00:15:08,500
Auntie.

321
00:15:08,501 --> 00:15:09,666
Let me help you.

322
00:15:10,833 --> 00:15:11,833
Mr. Lu.

323
00:15:12,041 --> 00:15:13,208
You don't need to do that.

324
00:15:13,375 --> 00:15:14,457
I've been the cleaner

325
00:15:14,458 --> 00:15:15,658
for Mr. Bei's place all along.

326
00:15:15,791 --> 00:15:17,916
I know Mr. Bei's household
habits and preferences.

327
00:15:21,416 --> 00:15:22,416
Bei Luqing...

328
00:15:23,416 --> 00:15:24,416
After Mr. Bei

329
00:15:24,541 --> 00:15:25,541
moved to Lingang.

330
00:15:26,125 --> 00:15:27,885
You're also in charge
of cleaning his place.

331
00:15:28,500 --> 00:15:29,291
Of course.

332
00:15:29,500 --> 00:15:30,707
Otherwise why would Mr. Bei

333
00:15:30,708 --> 00:15:32,500
fly me over from Yunjing?

334
00:15:32,833 --> 00:15:34,332
Not to brag,

335
00:15:34,333 --> 00:15:36,903
few cleaners
are as thorough as me these days.

336
00:15:37,458 --> 00:15:41,530
I remember where everything in people's
homes belongs after seeing it once.

337
00:15:41,777 --> 00:15:43,297
I never put things in the wrong place.

338
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,625
Unlike some cleaners nowadays,

339
00:15:45,833 --> 00:15:46,915
after one visit

340
00:15:46,916 --> 00:15:48,208
they rearrange everything

341
00:15:48,541 --> 00:15:49,958
so the owner can't find a thing.

342
00:15:50,708 --> 00:15:52,790
All the items in the house

343
00:15:52,791 --> 00:15:54,083
were organized by you?

344
00:15:54,166 --> 00:15:55,166
Of course.

345
00:15:57,583 --> 00:15:58,583
I see.

346
00:16:17,291 --> 00:16:17,875
Bro.
You're back.

347
00:16:19,375 --> 00:16:20,125
There are two more dishes.
Almost ready.

348
00:16:27,791 --> 00:16:28,916
Lu Xiaofan.

349
00:16:29,583 --> 00:16:31,023
You did this on purpose, didn't you?

350
00:16:33,166 --> 00:16:34,166
This...

351
00:16:35,208 --> 00:16:36,125
I picked this up

352
00:16:36,126 --> 00:16:37,375
at the supermarket today.

353
00:16:37,916 --> 00:16:38,750
I thought it was cute.
So I brought it back.

354
00:16:40,041 --> 00:16:41,241
Don't you think it looks nice?

355
00:16:42,875 --> 00:16:43,208
Bro.
Just wait a bit longer.

356
00:16:44,291 --> 00:16:45,411
The food will be ready soon.

357
00:17:11,250 --> 00:17:12,250
Bro.

358
00:17:12,291 --> 00:17:13,291
Still up this late?

359
00:17:15,458 --> 00:17:16,875
I didn't know when you'd be back,

360
00:17:17,541 --> 00:17:19,061
so I just wanted to wait a bit longer.

361
00:17:22,250 --> 00:17:23,250
Bro.

362
00:17:23,416 --> 00:17:24,856
What have you been busy with lately.

363
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,000
Xiaofan.

364
00:17:31,250 --> 00:17:32,650
I might need to go back to Yunjing.

365
00:17:33,333 --> 00:17:35,000
I'll be back after the New Year.

366
00:17:37,958 --> 00:17:40,791
Don't go anywhere during that time.

367
00:17:41,125 --> 00:17:42,125
Mm.

368
00:17:44,541 --> 00:17:45,541
Okay?

369
00:17:47,125 --> 00:17:48,125
Alright.

370
00:18:17,791 --> 00:18:18,416
Bro.

371
00:18:18,625 --> 00:18:19,625
Lu Xiaofan.

372
00:18:20,208 --> 00:18:21,000
This world

373
00:18:21,001 --> 00:18:23,750
belongs to bastards.

374
00:18:23,916 --> 00:18:24,916
Bei Lüxin?

375
00:18:25,375 --> 00:18:26,375
Where are you right now?

376
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:27,750
Ah?

377
00:18:28,041 --> 00:18:29,791
I don't know where I am.

378
00:18:29,916 --> 00:18:31,458
It's so high up here.

379
00:18:31,708 --> 00:18:32,708
Lu Xiaofan.

380
00:18:33,166 --> 00:18:35,165
The people down there
look so tiny. Bei Lüxin.

381
00:18:35,166 --> 00:18:36,166
Don't do anything reckless!

382
00:18:36,167 --> 00:18:37,500
I'm coming over right now.

383
00:18:48,583 --> 00:18:49,583
Lüxin.

384
00:18:50,708 --> 00:18:51,708
Lüxin.

385
00:18:57,791 --> 00:18:58,791
Lüxin.

386
00:18:59,083 --> 00:19:00,083
Lüxin.

387
00:19:01,458 --> 00:19:02,875
Lüxin, don't come any closer!

388
00:19:04,041 --> 00:19:04,791
Lüxin.

389
00:19:04,792 --> 00:19:06,112
Could you please come down first?

390
00:19:06,416 --> 00:19:07,416
Lüxin.

391
00:19:07,458 --> 00:19:08,458
Don't do anything rash.

392
00:19:08,666 --> 00:19:09,708
Stay back!

393
00:19:19,250 --> 00:19:20,500
Lu Xiaofan.

394
00:19:22,750 --> 00:19:25,416
You tell me... why am I so unlucky?

395
00:19:31,708 --> 00:19:34,541
We don't even share the same father.

396
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:40,916
So why can't we have different mothers too?

397
00:19:42,791 --> 00:19:44,458
Why?!

398
00:19:44,583 --> 00:19:46,958
Why?!

399
00:19:50,375 --> 00:19:51,375
Lüxin.

400
00:19:52,875 --> 00:19:54,041
Xiaofan.

401
00:20:00,208 --> 00:20:01,375
Song Qianyu.

402
00:20:01,916 --> 00:20:03,125
Do you think she's nice?

403
00:20:04,541 --> 00:20:05,708
What's so good about her?

404
00:20:06,333 --> 00:20:07,875
What's so special about her?!

405
00:20:08,583 --> 00:20:09,750
Song Qianyu.

406
00:20:21,291 --> 00:20:24,041
He finally admitted it today.

407
00:20:27,291 --> 00:20:29,833
He said... he has someone he likes.

408
00:20:32,375 --> 00:20:34,166
My mom set them up.

409
00:20:36,625 --> 00:20:37,791
Song Qianyu.

410
00:20:38,916 --> 00:20:40,208
Song Qianyu.

411
00:20:40,875 --> 00:20:42,166
Song Qianyu.

412
00:20:57,750 --> 00:20:58,750
Lu Xiaofan.

413
00:21:03,250 --> 00:21:05,250
Am I... totally worthless?

414
00:21:06,458 --> 00:21:07,458
No.

415
00:21:08,458 --> 00:21:09,791
I don't think that at all.

416
00:21:10,916 --> 00:21:12,250
Let's just go home first, okay?

417
00:21:13,250 --> 00:21:14,250
Home.

418
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,000
Let's head home first.

419
00:21:17,291 --> 00:21:19,500
He has someone he likes...

420
00:21:20,250 --> 00:21:22,458
He has someone he likes...

421
00:21:24,416 --> 00:21:25,416
Is anyone home?

422
00:21:26,375 --> 00:21:27,375
My dad...

423
00:21:27,625 --> 00:21:28,665
is dining

424
00:21:28,666 --> 00:21:29,791
with the staff on duty.

425
00:21:30,666 --> 00:21:31,666
My brother...

426
00:21:32,291 --> 00:21:34,458
My brother went to the
restaurant my mom booked.

427
00:21:35,166 --> 00:21:35,791
Careful.

428
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:37,458
And that... that homewrecker.

429
00:21:38,166 --> 00:21:39,166
Song Qianyu.

430
00:21:40,083 --> 00:21:41,083
Song Qianyu.

431
00:21:41,458 --> 00:21:42,458
Be careful.

432
00:21:46,500 --> 00:21:47,500
Xiaofan.

433
00:21:48,500 --> 00:21:49,500
Xiaofan.

434
00:21:50,583 --> 00:21:51,583
Lüxin.

435
00:21:52,083 --> 00:21:53,142
You should get some rest first.

436
00:21:53,166 --> 00:21:53,875
Just rest.
Xiaofan.

437
00:21:55,333 --> 00:21:56,333
Don't go.

438
00:21:57,083 --> 00:21:58,083
Xiaofan.

439
00:21:58,375 --> 00:21:59,375
Xiaofan.

440
00:22:03,208 --> 00:22:04,208
Xiaofan.

441
00:22:04,416 --> 00:22:05,416
Xiaofan.

442
00:22:06,083 --> 00:22:08,291
Can we make love? Please?

443
00:22:09,958 --> 00:22:11,125
Xiaofan.

444
00:22:12,583 --> 00:22:13,583
Lüxin.

445
00:22:13,666 --> 00:22:15,666
- Lüxin, don't do this.
- Lu Xiaofan!

446
00:22:22,666 --> 00:22:25,166
I thought you'd never leave me.

447
00:22:30,708 --> 00:22:31,750
You drank too much.

448
00:22:32,333 --> 00:22:33,375
Get some rest first.

449
00:22:41,333 --> 00:22:42,791
Lu Xiaofan.

450
00:22:46,250 --> 00:22:48,625
We could make do together. It'd be fine.

451
00:23:03,750 --> 00:23:06,291
Truth is, I never looked down on you.

452
00:23:10,833 --> 00:23:12,553
In fact, what I've been really afraid of...

453
00:23:15,458 --> 00:23:17,625
is that I'll be looked down on again.

454
00:23:27,666 --> 00:23:29,875
I felt like... only by
constantly putting you down...

455
00:23:34,083 --> 00:23:36,250
could I feel like I wasn't
that worthless myself.

456
00:23:38,875 --> 00:23:40,041
I'm sorry...

457
00:23:42,208 --> 00:23:43,708
I'm sorry...

458
00:23:58,041 --> 00:23:58,875
Lüxin.

459
00:23:59,041 --> 00:24:00,916
Would you like some soy milk?

460
00:24:06,875 --> 00:24:07,833
Should I... hide?
Lüxin.

461
00:24:10,416 --> 00:24:11,416
No need.

462
00:24:12,541 --> 00:24:13,541
Coming, coming!

463
00:24:18,500 --> 00:24:18,875
Lüxin.
I'll go make some and be right back.

464
00:24:19,833 --> 00:24:20,833
Everyone...

465
00:24:21,750 --> 00:24:22,750
Auntie Lin.

466
00:24:32,125 --> 00:24:33,291
Xiaofan, you're back!

467
00:24:33,666 --> 00:24:34,934
Come downstairs and have something to eat.

468
00:24:34,958 --> 00:24:36,041
Everyone's here.

469
00:24:44,833 --> 00:24:46,791
Fanfan's back. Come, take a seat.

470
00:24:49,875 --> 00:24:50,958
It's good to have you back.

471
00:24:52,125 --> 00:24:53,309
You've really lost a lot of weight.

472
00:24:53,333 --> 00:24:55,293
Nothing out there tastes
as good as home cooking.

473
00:25:05,416 --> 00:25:06,416
Bei...

474
00:25:07,291 --> 00:25:08,291
Uncle Bei.

475
00:25:09,750 --> 00:25:10,990
I have to head back to Lingang.

476
00:25:11,416 --> 00:25:12,500
So I'll take my leave now.

477
00:25:13,958 --> 00:25:15,916
Do you have urgent
business back in Lingang?

478
00:25:17,916 --> 00:25:18,916
No.

479
00:25:20,708 --> 00:25:23,250
It's just... it's not really
convenient for me to stay here.

480
00:25:26,791 --> 00:25:27,791
Not convenient?

481
00:25:29,791 --> 00:25:32,041
Xiaofan, what exactly
are you trying to say?

482
00:25:40,875 --> 00:25:42,666
Aren't Lüxin and I...

483
00:25:42,958 --> 00:25:44,318
in the middle of getting divorced?

484
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:58,541
Then let me see you off, Xiaofan.

485
00:26:07,083 --> 00:26:08,208
Let's go, Xiaofan.

486
00:26:11,833 --> 00:26:12,833
Xiaofan.

487
00:26:16,958 --> 00:26:17,458
Lu Xiaofan.

488
00:26:17,833 --> 00:26:18,833
You bastard!

489
00:26:25,041 --> 00:26:26,041
Alright.

490
00:26:27,250 --> 00:26:28,041
Auntie Lin.
Grab a towel.

491
00:26:28,959 --> 00:26:30,000
Wipe Xiaofan's face.

492
00:26:36,541 --> 00:26:37,916
Conflicts between young people

493
00:26:38,208 --> 00:26:40,000
are totally normal.

494
00:26:43,791 --> 00:26:47,250
But you want a divorce over
such a trivial disagreement?

495
00:26:49,714 --> 00:26:53,000
Where have you placed
your marriage and your family?

496
00:27:01,166 --> 00:27:03,610
I will be discussing this matter with Mrs. Lu.

497
00:27:04,458 --> 00:27:06,416
You ought to reflect on yourself.

498
00:27:12,875 --> 00:27:13,875
Mm.

499
00:28:04,125 --> 00:28:05,125
Let's go.

500
00:28:09,583 --> 00:28:10,500
I came back because...

501
00:28:10,501 --> 00:28:12,500
If Bei Lüxin does not want a divorce,

502
00:28:14,291 --> 00:28:15,375
what are you going to do?

503
00:28:17,833 --> 00:28:19,041
Well, what can I do then?

504
00:28:21,416 --> 00:28:22,916
Then don't bring up divorce.

505
00:28:24,291 --> 00:28:25,291
Take it slow.

506
00:28:25,791 --> 00:28:27,208
Understood?

507
00:28:29,333 --> 00:28:30,500
I understand.

508
00:28:42,500 --> 00:28:43,625
You...

509
00:29:09,041 --> 00:29:10,041
Lu Xiaofan.

510
00:29:10,166 --> 00:29:12,375
What on earth is wrong with you?

511
00:29:13,500 --> 00:29:14,957
You got Uncle Bei so furious...

512
00:29:14,958 --> 00:29:16,518
even Mom got reprimanded because of it.

513
00:29:17,083 --> 00:29:17,750
Do you have any idea?

514
00:29:17,751 --> 00:29:18,874
All because of your mess,

515
00:29:18,875 --> 00:29:19,833
Dad's blood pressure spiked.

516
00:29:19,834 --> 00:29:21,415
He's laid up at home with a bad headache.

517
00:29:21,416 --> 00:29:22,041
Lu Xiaofan.

518
00:29:22,042 --> 00:29:23,166
Wreck yourself all you want,

519
00:29:23,333 --> 00:29:24,559
just don't drag the whole family down.

520
00:29:24,583 --> 00:29:25,583
Do you get it or not?!

521
00:29:29,708 --> 00:29:30,875
Our parents are coming over

522
00:29:31,083 --> 00:29:33,416
to smooth things over
between our family and the Beis.

523
00:29:33,500 --> 00:29:35,000
Don't be muddle-headed then.

524
00:29:35,041 --> 00:29:36,041
Got it?

525
00:29:36,375 --> 00:29:37,375
Of course.

526
00:29:37,541 --> 00:29:39,166
We don't have to lean on the Beis.

527
00:29:39,583 --> 00:29:40,291
But when it comes down to people,

528
00:29:40,333 --> 00:29:41,541
it all boils down to ability.

529
00:29:41,833 --> 00:29:43,250
Some rely on talent,

530
00:29:43,333 --> 00:29:44,791
others on contacts.

531
00:29:44,833 --> 00:29:45,833
That's just life.

532
00:29:45,875 --> 00:29:46,875
Understood?

533
00:29:47,333 --> 00:29:47,875
Alright.

534
00:29:47,916 --> 00:29:49,236
Go do some self-reflection first.

535
00:30:08,583 --> 00:30:09,791
You should go to sleep first.

536
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:11,291
I don't know when I'll wrap up.

537
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:16,625
I heard the whole Lu clan's
coming out to meddle again.

538
00:30:16,958 --> 00:30:17,958
Mm.

539
00:30:18,916 --> 00:30:20,316
They've already bought the tickets.

540
00:30:20,458 --> 00:30:21,498
They're arriving tomorrow.

541
00:30:23,083 --> 00:30:24,443
I've got something to do tomorrow.

542
00:30:24,875 --> 00:30:25,708
Everything over there,

543
00:30:25,875 --> 00:30:26,916
you handle it yourself.

544
00:30:27,750 --> 00:30:28,750
Don't worry, bro.

545
00:30:30,458 --> 00:30:31,708
It's not the first time.

546
00:30:41,333 --> 00:30:42,958
Do it for your parents,

547
00:30:43,791 --> 00:30:44,916
and stop this nonsense.

548
00:30:46,416 --> 00:30:47,166
Mm.

549
00:30:47,333 --> 00:30:48,333
Alright.

550
00:30:53,625 --> 00:30:55,000
Some rely on talent,

551
00:30:55,083 --> 00:30:56,583
others on contacts.

552
00:30:56,625 --> 00:30:57,541
That's just life.

553
00:30:57,625 --> 00:30:58,625
Understood?

554
00:30:59,125 --> 00:30:59,666
Alright.

555
00:30:59,708 --> 00:31:01,041
Go do some self-reflection first.

556
00:31:02,750 --> 00:31:03,750
Are you done?

557
00:31:04,625 --> 00:31:05,791
I have something to tell you.

558
00:31:22,708 --> 00:31:23,708
Bro.

559
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:25,000
Have some fruit.

560
00:32:15,375 --> 00:32:16,375
Lu Xiaofan.

561
00:32:17,291 --> 00:32:18,833
You did that on purpose, didn't you?
